@base <https://ontoboard.org/patterns/pmdco-behavioral-property.owl> .

<https://ontoboard.org/patterns/pmdco-behavioral-property.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                dcterms:description "Behavioral material properties manifest only in specific circumstances: yield strength is the material's behavior under mechanical stress, realized in a mechanical process. The property is a specifically dependent continuant borne by the material and given a value by a scalar value specification."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
                                                                dcterms:title "Behavioral property"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label moved to skos:prefLabel x5; label moved to skos:altLabel x1; label added x9; term declared x5;
- header: dcterms:title \"Behavioral property\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
- header: dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> - https://github.com/materialdigital/core-ontology
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en .

